@Strudel Dad

Can’t it be both? I had fun at the party! It was a fun party.

(Not sure how couple is an adjective, but it could be a verb…)

@sotto voce

Well I suppose “early bloomers” is more commonly a term for young men and women who hit puberty early or reach an unexpected level of success or talent at an early age.

This was too much to hope for for a Monday but I was wondering if it would be a misdirection for a term for medieval underpants.
